/*
  AddAnnotationPopover.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 modal/dialog · 0002 · AddAnnotationPopover (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  AddAnnotationPopover resolves (table "AddAnnotationPopover") lives here with its
  web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (components/charts/AddAnnotationPopover.tsx). The second group is the six
  category labels (CATEGORY_OPTIONS). The remainder backs the native state
  envelope (loading, empty, error retry, freshness chip, connectivity banner),
  the header close affordance, and the VoiceOver builders.
*/

